  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "For the next major version of Fedora and associated tools, we will be bringing all of the dependencies up to date with their current upstream versions along with requiring a newer JVM version. ",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "These issues are managed within a GitHub Project ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "attrs": {
        "url": "https://github.com/fcrepo/fcrepo/issues?q=label%3A%22upgrade%22%20"
       },
       "type": "inlineCard"
      },
      {
       "text": " ",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Jared has had an initial go at updating the POM and seeing what breaks. This work can be found in ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "attrs": {
        "url": "https://github.com/fcrepo/fcrepo/tree/feature/fcrepo7"
       },
       "type": "inlineCard"
      },
      {
       "text": " Although this is well; behind main now it may contain some useful findings or reusable code/configs",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
